re missing from FIFA 19 data!). That's a real-world data quirk. So the answer to \"Who are the highest-rated players at Flamengo?\" from FIFA data would be empty for club Flamengo — the spec example says \"Filter FIFA data by Club containing 'Flamengo'\". OK, so the data will return 0 and that's factually consistent with the dataset. My tests should reflect the actual data (e.g., use Grêmio/Santos/Fluminense for club queries).\n\nThe MCPServer 2.x API has `tool` decorator, `run_stdio_async`, `list_tools`, `call_tool`, etc. Let me check how to construct and use it. Let me look at the migration guide briefly or the module source.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05dece24d001SDR67va5hXuSMR","sessionID":"ses_fa214f21cffeb5QAv8JGSE5SjQ","messageID":"msg_05decb6ea0016RtItXLAGbRc1u"}}
