are \"Vitoria\" → folded to most prominent \"vitoria-ba\" — need vitoria-ba counts > vitoria-es so fold direction is correct. From collision data, Vitória-BA appears in Série A (many), Vitória-ES in Série B/C (fewer). OK.\n\nHmm — actually wait, there's a real risk here: which club is BR-Football's bare \"Vitoria\"? Let me check quickly whether BR-Football Serie A contains \"Vitoria\" (Vitória-BA was in Serie A 2018) — I'll verify after writing the loader by checking the standings output for Vitória-BA in 2018 (should be relegated, 37 pts from my earlier calc — that matched history!). Actually my earlier quick standings (before proper normalization) showed vitoria 37 pts in 2018 relegated ✓ matches history (Vitória-BA was relegated in 2018 with 37 pts). That quick calc merged ALL \"vitoria*\" — but the points matched exactly, suggesting BR-Football bare \"Vitoria\" didn't double-count. I'll verify with the real loader.\n\nNow write loader.py.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05df5874e001s0t5JJDA32GALO","sessionID":"ses_fa214f21cffeb5QAv8JGSE5SjQ","messageID":"msg_05df53c0c001T63eeStYX1p2uI"}}
